# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Files here were a mix of CRLF and LF, sometimes within a single file, which repeatedly broke
# tooling that splits text into lines: a pattern written with one ending silently matches nothing,
# or matches a chunk spanning two lines and deletes both. Storing everything as LF removes the
# whole class of problem; Windows editors handle LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
